 "books": {
  "4b4ce400": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 2521,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 3,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "If anyone finds this, please, do your best to stop them. There were only a few left at the tower when I scribbled this note and crawled away.\r\n\r\nAlso, try and get Raani's lucky feather from his body. He liked to tell tall tales about how he plucked it from some kind of firebird and I think he'd want to make sure that it made its way back home.\r\n\r\nIf you are also able to retrieve Arvensus Shadowsong's family signet from his body, please do so. High Elder Shadowsong is his uncle and he would want it to be returned to the family.",
   "time": 1792526321,
   "title": "Bloody Note",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Zephras Isle"
  },
  "4f53a1ae": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 2521,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 2,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "As soon as the fighting stopped, they started moving massive crates of windstones to the top of the tower. The leader, some kind of priest, said something about a ritual.\r\n\r\nI'm writing this note just in case I don't make it back to Shen'dar to warn Aonda, but they are doing something here. Something bad.",
   "time": 1792526321,
   "title": "Bloody Note",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Zephras Isle"
  },
  "909666a3": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 2521,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 1,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The cult hit us by surprise. Raani never saw it coming and Arvensus took a sword to the gut. For my part, I took a lightning bolt to the chest and blacked out. They never bothered to finish me off... I guess they assumed my wounds would do me in. When it's all said and done, I suspect they might.",
   "time": 1792526321,
   "title": "Bloody Note",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Zephras Isle"
  }
 },
 "gossip": {
